# Generated context index is covered by *.db above. Keep both runtime files
# untracked; an ignore rule cannot hide a file already in the Git index.
# The append-only access log is written on reads (not source).
.dunkingsheep/access.jsonl
.venv/
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/

# The desk writes its own credentials and sqlite store here when VP_DATA_DIR is
# unset (web/app.py: DATA = os.getenv("VP_DATA_DIR", ROOT / "data")). A test or an
# app run inside a checkout then leaves auth.json, owner-credentials and
# messages.sqlite3 behind, and a broad `git add -A` swept three of them onto a
# PUBLIC branch (t726 review of #143). Never commit this directory.
data/
